# Keep every text file LF in the repo and in the working tree.
# Without this, Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf=true) produce CRLF files while
# Linux CI produces LF, which made generated artifacts (dataset revision hash,
# README table sync) drift by OS and fail the CI "generated files are in sync"
# check. LF everywhere + line-ending-normalized hashing makes local and CI
# byte-identical.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit binary guard so archives, images and fonts are never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
